@startuml
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI, Arial, sans-serif"

<style>
sequenceDiagram {
  participant {
    Padding 25
    Margin 15
  }
}
</style>

skinparam defaultFontSize 19
skinparam sequenceGroupFontSize 19
skinparam sequenceReferenceFontSize 18
skinparam arrowFontSize 18
skinparam noteFontSize 17
skinparam participantFontSize 19
skinparam actorFontSize 19

skinparam maxMessageSize 380
skinparam wrapWidth 380
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam shadowing false

skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #2C3E50
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #2980B9
skinparam sequenceGroupHeaderFontStyle bold

autonumber

actor "Client App\n[MapLibre GL 3D]" as C #EBF5FB
participant "Fastify 5 BFF API\n[Route Risk Engine]" as API #E8F8F5
participant "OSRM Routing Service\n[Road Topology]" as ROUTE #FEF9E7
database "PostgreSQL / PostGIS\n[GiST Spatial Store]" as GIS #F2F4F4
participant "Multi-Dimensional\nRisk Scoring Engine" as RISK #FDEDEC

== Phase 1: Route Request & Spatial Corridor Generation ==

C -> API: POST /api/v1/routes/plan\n(origin, destination, vehicle: "motorcycle")
activate API

API -> ROUTE: Request candidate itineraries (Fastest, Shortest, Alternative)
activate ROUTE
ROUTE --> API: Return 3 GeoJSON LineStrings with distances D & times T
deactivate ROUTE

== Phase 2: Spatiotemporal Sampling & Two-Tier Spatial Corridor Query ==

loop For each candidate route option (Fastest, Shortest, Alternative)
    API -> API: Discretize LineString into sample waypoints {p_i}\n(Spatial step ds <= 5 km, Temporal advance dt <= 15 min)
    
    API -> GIS: Query corridor observations within 15 km buffer\n(ST_DWithin on geography, accelerated by GiST BBOX filter)
    activate GIS
    GIS --> API: Return active weather station observations (tau <= 180 min)
    deactivate GIS
    
    == Phase 3: Vehicle-Differentiated Hazard Evaluation & Multi-Objective Scoring ==
    
    API -> RISK: Evaluate 6-dimensional risk matrix for each point p_i\n(Stricter motorcycle thresholds: Rain, Wind, Temp, Vis, Storm, Alert)
    activate RISK
    RISK --> API: Return point severities S(p_i) and Max-Severity S_route
    deactivate RISK
    
    API -> API: Compute balanced scalarization score:\nScore = w_risk * S_route + w_time * T_norm + w_dist * D_norm
end

API -> API: Rank candidate routes and designate Weather-Safer Recommended route

API --> C: HTTP 200 OK (GeoJSON FeatureCollection with annotated risk segments)
deactivate API

== Phase 4: Dynamic 3D Geospatial Visualization ==

C -> C: Render 3D dynamic route polyline with risk color coding\n(Green: Low, Amber: Caution, Crimson: High)
activate C
deactivate C

@enduml
